###########################
#  Main text

BEGIN_TEXT
Each  closed curve \( C \) is oriented by specifying a unit normal (and hence a unit tangent). Each curve encloses a regular region \( R \). 
Determine the sign of \[ (a)  \oint_C (F \cdot n) ds \quad \text{ and } \quad (b) \iint_R \text{div}(F)dA. \] 

$BR 
\{ image( "k3-vec-field-square-outward.png", width=>250, height=>250 ) \}

$BR
a) \( \oint_C (F \cdot n) ds \) is:
END_TEXT

